{
  "name": "l0_ambient_radius_level",
  "about": "`CAmbientGeneric::Spawn` 0x101ac310 calls FUN_101ac570 at 0x101ac321 with `m_spawnflags & 1` (0x101ac2f0) and `m_radius` (+0x450, key `radius`) and stores the answer in `m_iSoundLevel` (+0x454) at 0x101ac326. The helper's arms, in order: `radius > 0.0` strictly (FCOMP [0x104454c4], C3|C0 masked, so 0, -10 and NaN take the zero arm), then any nonzero everywhere byte -> 0, else trunc(40.0 + 20.0 * log10(radius * 0x3F9C71C71C71C71C)) through __ftol 0x10431320 (constants 0x1047aa18, 0x104704a8, 0x10462950). Vectors: 300 -> 58, 600 -> 64, 256 -> 57, 100 -> 48, 1000 -> 68, 1 -> 8, 0.5 -> 2, 0.1 -> -11 (negative levels are stored), 0 -> 0, -10 -> 0, 300 with spawnflags 1 -> 0. The precision-fragile radii (36, 360: x87 PC 53 vs 64, unrecovered) are kept out. Reported as `fail`, a level, a branch or the stored word differs from retail's.",
  "stage": "arena",
  "seed": 1,
  "duration": 2.1,
